    <string name="pairing_direction_callout_body">Helm Pad advertises itself as a keyboard; your Mac or PC has to scan and add it from its own Bluetooth settings. If your computer isn\'t listed below, add Helm Pad from that computer\'s Bluetooth pane.</string>

